# Real adapters over real bodies: StockpileDepositHost and GroundSpillHost driven through
# KingdomDepositEngine.Fill in a really founded camp. Four cases -- an ordinary delivered parcel
# into the store and onto bare ground, a real held stack at exactly int.MaxValue that still reads
# and still credits, and a total past int.MaxValue refusing on the stockpile host and on the ground
# host with zero credit and every standing body untouched.
#
# SYNTHETIC SETUP, DISCLOSED: the camp is founded by the harness, and every large stack is a
# fixture body whose Stacker.StackCount the harness assigns directly (1,200,000,000 each, one at
# exactly int.MaxValue) carrying NeverStack so the engine cannot merge two rows into one. The
# engine PERMITS such a count (Stacker._StackCount is a plain int field with no ceiling); nothing
# here claims ordinary play produces one. The fixture also performs a synthetic-id-allocation: a
# freshly created object carries no engine id until something asks, and IDIfAssigned is a plain
# read while GameObject.ID allocates on first access, so the fixture asks once per body it makes,
# while it is still building that body and never from an observation path. Every report line
# carries synthetic-id-allocation=true and the count of bodies allocated. Not a rendered Charter, no save/load, no cold-load, and
# no general camp-acceptance claim. Refs #111.
DESCRIPTION=raw delivery censuses refuse a hold past int.MaxValue on both real hosts, credit nothing, and leave every standing body untouched
REQUEST=founding-first-city
START=8.22@40,12
SCRIPT=stagedigest;deposit-overflow-setup;deposit-overflow-check;deposit-overflow-check;deposit-overflow-check;deposit-overflow-check;stagedigest
VERBS=deposit-overflow-setup,deposit-overflow-check
EXPECT=stagedigest:OK~founded=false,deposit-overflow-setup:OK~native-deposit-overflow phase=1,deposit-overflow-check:OK~native-deposit-overflow phase=2,deposit-overflow-check:OK~native-deposit-overflow phase=3,deposit-overflow-check:OK~native-deposit-overflow phase=4,deposit-overflow-check:OK~native-deposit-overflow cases=4 passed=4 failed=0,stagedigest:OK~founded=true,COMPLETE
SET=materials,native-regression,test-only
TIMEOUT=1200
